title: "Evaluating AI Uplift to Influence Operations: A Kill-Chain-Anchored Capability Framework"
abstract: >-
  Public, sanitized release of the evaluation framework and aggregate results for
  "One Prompt at a Time: Why Safety Benchmarks Miss Multi-Step Misuse". Task bank,
  elicitation prompts, multi-turn scaffolding and raw model outputs are withheld.
